    "sections": {
        "description": "Online Learning LMS is a responsive, modern, and feature-rich theme designed for educators, online tutors, schools, universities, and e-learning platforms aiming to deliver courses effectively in the digital space. Ideal for creating online academies, training institutes, coaching centers, or professional certification sites, it enables course creation, management, and monetization with ease. Learners can explore courses, enroll instantly, attempt quizzes, submit assignments, earn certificates, and track progress through interactive dashboards. Built with optimized, SEO-friendly code, this theme ensures fast loading, superior performance, and seamless accessibility across all devices. It supports essential plugins such as LearnPress or Tutor LMS for course management, WooCommerce for selling courses or memberships, Contact Form 7 for inquiries, WPML for multilingual learning, and Yoast SEO for improved search visibility. Additional features like drip content, multi-instructor setup, course prerequisites, and discussion forums enhance engagement and flexibility for learners and instructors alike. Perfect for creating professional e-learning websites, Online Learning LMS empowers educators to deliver structured, interactive, and accessible education while maintaining a sleek, user-friendly design."
    },
